==Trivia==
*I'm not here anymore.'s Japanese name, Mō watashi wa soko ni imasen ("I'm not there anymore"), is a reference to the line "Soko ni watshi wa imasen" ("I'm not there") from "[[wikipedia:ja:千の風になって|Sen no Kaze ni Natte]]", a Japanese translation of the bereavement poem "[[wikipedia:Do Not Stand at My Grave and Weep|Immortality]]".

